{"id":943140,"shortDescription":"Sparklite es un juego de acción y aventura ambientado en la siempre cambiante tierra de Geodia. Lucha contra tus enemigos desde una perspectiva superior usando un arsenal de dispositivos, armas y equipo. ¡Explora rincones peligrosos del mundo generado proceduralmente, acaba con titanes de la industria minera y usa el poder de Sparklite!","developers":["Red Blue Games"],"publishers":["Silver Lining Interactive"],"categories":["Un jugador","Multijugador","Cooperativo","Coop. a pantalla (com)partida","Pantalla partida/compartida","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Cromos de Steam","Steam Cloud","Remote Play Together","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"14 NOV 2019","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943140/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748380634","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943140/ss_1dfaeb16499bba0b8a4210960c5d7adc7025d221.600x338.jpg?t=1748380634","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943140/ss_1dfaeb16499bba0b8a4210960c5d7adc7025d221.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748380634"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943140/ss_798b6aad3f5370c113c1e747ec1664c1cfa5a1df.600x338.jpg?t=1748380634","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943140/ss_798b6aad3f5370c113c1e747ec1664c1cfa5a1df.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748380634"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943140/ss_1134f5220b77bd706516db82b7c5152d213c2138.600x338.jpg?t=1748380634","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943140/ss_1134f5220b77bd706516db82b7c5152d213c2138.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748380634"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943140/ss_de8f9007830d3a0aceec432920ee9a9054bab00a.600x338.jpg?t=1748380634","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam